WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
First, open Shortcuts to set up Kotori’s record action

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Press and hold Record Entry with the microphone icon, then choose New Shortcut

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Leave Entry blank, name the shortcut Kotori, and save it

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Swipe down from the top right and add Kotori’s Record Entry control

5
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Next time, tap this control. Shortcuts opens and asks for the entry

6
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Enter the description and amount, then tap Done. Kotori stays in the background

7
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:13.200
Check the pending count in Control Center too
